<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Waste Management Center, Mumbai — Sayali Lamne</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Raleway:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #111111;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.98);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 80px;
      padding: 24px 130px 24px 70px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .nav a {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #111;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav a:hover { color: #db634c; }
    .back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #333;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      border: 1.5px solid #333;
      padding: 12px 28px;
    }
    .back {
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .back:hover { text-decoration: none; transform: scale(1.05); }
    .back .back-arrow {
      color: #bbb;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .back:hover .back-arrow { color: #db634c; }

    .hero-split {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: calc(100vh - 80px - 80px);
      max-height: 900px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 80px;
    }
    .overview-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 0 0;
    }
    .overview-bar .meta {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: #111;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .hero-right {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
    }
    .hero-right img {
      position: absolute;
      width: 103.5%;
      height: auto;
      left: -1.75%;
      top: calc(-5% - 335px);
      display: block;
    }

    @media (min-width: 1600px) {
      .hero-split {
        max-height: 900px;
      }
    }
    .scroll-cue {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -1px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 0 20px;
      color: #b3b3b3;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;
      z-index: 2;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .scroll-cue:hover { color: #8a8a8a; }
    .scroll-cue__label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .scroll-cue__arrows {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      line-height: 0.55;
      animation: scrollFloat 1.9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .scroll-cue__arrows svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
    @keyframes scrollFloat {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(5px); }
    }

    .hero-left {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 0 5% 56px 70px;
      height: 100%;
      width: 45%;
    }
    .hero-num {
      font-size: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      line-height: 0.9;
      user-select: none;
      pointer-events: none;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .hero-left-content {}

    .content {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px 1.7% 100px;
    }

    .project-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .project-subtitle {
      font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 26px);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #111;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .project-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #db634c;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .meta {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #111;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .body-text p {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: #111;
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .body-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .full-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .img-caption {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #888;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .grid-2 img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .grid-3 img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

    .section-heading {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111;
      margin-top: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #db634c;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-logo" href="/">SL</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#">Research</a>
      <a href="#">About me</a>
      <a href="mailto:sayali03lamne@gmail.com">Contacts</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero-split">
    <div class="hero-left">
      <span class="hero-num">01</span>
      <div class="hero-left-content">
        <h1 class="project-title">Waste Management Center, Mumbai</h1>
        <span class="project-tag">Application of Sustainable Design Strategies</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right">
      <img src="/7. Waste Management Center/aerial view-1-PS-website.jpg" alt="Waste Management Center, Mumbai — Aerial View" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="overview-bar">
    <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.7%; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8; padding-bottom: 20px;">
      <div class="meta">
        <div>Competition Entry — Asia's Young Designer Award &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2019</div>
        <div>Location: Mulund, Mumbai &nbsp;|&nbsp; Project Type: Industrial &amp; Public</div>
        <div>Tools: Revit, Rhino, Grasshopper, Ladybug</div>
        <div>Type of Work: Individual</div>
      </div>
      <a href="#content" class="scroll-cue" aria-label="Scroll down">
        <span class="scroll-cue__label">Scroll Down</span>
        <span class="scroll-cue__arrows" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="content" class="content">

    <div class="body-text">
      <p>The theme of this competition was to provide a design solution for the 'Sustainable future' of our built environment. Considering the exceeding amount of waste and shortage of landfill spaces in Mumbai a waste management center was proposed to replace an existing landfill site.</p>
      <p>The program is composed of a waste management area for the segregation of waste, a waste-to-electricity generation plant to produce 'Clean Electricity', a cow shed &amp; organic farming, and workshop spaces for community artists, who can create crafts from recyclable waste. Overall building is design with 'Whole System Thinking' approach &amp; aimed to encourage people about the 'Circular Economy'.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Site & Concept -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;"><img src="/7.%20Waste%20Management%20Center/Icons/location.png" alt="" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain;" />Site &amp; Challenges</h2>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <div style="max-width: 70%;">
        <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/Site location.jpg" alt="Site Location — Mulund, Mumbai" />
        <p class="img-caption">Site Location</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 64px;"><img src="/7.%20Waste%20Management%20Center/Icons/hand.png" alt="" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain;" />Design Proposal</h2>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/flow diagram-latest-2.png" alt="Flow of the Waste Management" />
      <p class="img-caption" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">Flow of the Waste Management</p>
    </div>

    <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/Concept-2.png" alt="Design Process Diagram" style="margin-top: 16px;" />
    <p class="img-caption" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">Design Process Diagram</p>

    <!-- Massing & Form -->

    <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/5_W - AXO.jpg" alt="Isometric View" />
    <p class="img-caption">Isometric View</p>

    <!-- Solar Radiation Mapping -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;"><img src="/7.%20Waste%20Management%20Center/Icons/solution.png" alt="" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain;" />Solar Radiation Mapping &amp; Sustainable Strategies</h2>

    <div style="overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 4px;">
      <img style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin-top:-20%;margin-bottom:-20%;" src="/7. Waste Management Center/sky domes.png" alt="Sky Dome — Total, Diffuse, and Direct Radiation" />
    </div>
    <p class="img-caption">Sky Dome visualizations for solar radiation mapping over summer solstice time period</p>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 40px; align-items: start; margin-top: 32px;">
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>We performed solar radiation studies for summer solstice (i.e. 21st June to 21st December) to understand, which sides of the building are receiving more solar radiation.</p>
        <p>The incident solar radiation analysis on the building assisting in designing location of fenestrations, glazing areas, shading devices and facade treatment. Further helping to in passive heating strategies by utilizing the thermal radiation, improve indoor thermal comfort &amp; improve energy performance of the building.</p>
        <p>The patches on the sky dome with higher solar radiation helped us to find the angle of orientation for the solar panels.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;" src="/7. Waste Management Center/sky dome-1.png" alt="Sky Dome — 3D Radiation Analysis" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/waste management centre - sectinal perspective-1.jpg" alt="Sectional Perspective" />
    <p class="img-caption">Sectional Perspective Showing Sustainable Strategies Used</p>

    <!-- Interior Views -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;"><img src="/7.%20Waste%20Management%20Center/Icons/photo-camera.png" alt="" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain;" />Architectural Views</h2>

    <img class="full-img" src="/7. Waste Management Center/Interior view.png" alt="Interior Views" />

    <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <p>Semi-open spaces such as connecting spaces with openings to frame views, staircases facing central courtyards, and courtyards on the building edges along with rooftop gardens are designed to make spaces interact with nature. Further it helps to blur the boundary between inside and outside in the public area by creating flexible spaces and opportunities to connect with surrounding landscape.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <a class="back" href="/projects/computational-design">Back <span class="back-arrow">›</span></a>
    </div>

  </div>
  <script is:inline>
    (function() {
      const el = document.querySelector('.scroll-cue');
      function update() {
        const hidden = window.scrollY > 60;
        el.style.opacity = hidden ? '0' : '1';
        el.style.pointerEvents = hidden ? 'none' : 'auto';
      }
      update();
      window.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
